Dialogue: 3,0:00:10.12,0:00:14.62,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OFFICERS IN A SUBMARINE WARDROOM · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The patient is a 19-year-old seaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}His appendix is inflamed, and part of it is already
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.17,0:00:36.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}turning black.
