Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}If they wait, it can burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.07,0:00:40.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}If they operate, the man holding the knife has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:43.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}helped at a few appendectomies, as an assistant.
