Dialogue: 3,0:00:36.81,0:00:42.56,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This is the true story of that operation, the two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}that followed it, and the Navy job it helped create.
