Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:09.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On December 10, 1941, Japanese bombers struck the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:13.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seadragon was moored beside another submarine, Sealion.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.48,0:01:12.23,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
