Dialogue: 3,0:01:06.48,0:01:12.23,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:01:06.48,0:01:12.23,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE ON THE SURFACE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:31.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Lipes was born in 1920, in New Castle, Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.56,0:01:34.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When the bombers came, he was aboard Sealion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He ended up in the water and was picked up that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seadragon's own pharmacist's mate had been wounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:42.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and Lipes took his place.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.84,0:01:34.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:28.84,0:01:34.59,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:01:28.84,0:01:34.59,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:01:28.84,0:01:34.59,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A LONE SUBMARINE ON AN EMPTY SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:46.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He had joined the Navy in 1936, trained in its
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hospital course in San Diego, and worked in naval
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:52.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hospitals in Philadelphia and near Manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1941, he went to submarines.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.10,0:01:48.85,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 934 0 l 934 132 l 0 132{\p0}
