Dialogue: 3,0:01:43.10,0:01:48.85,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}U.S. NAVAL HOSPITAL OKINAWA · OCT. 26, 2026 · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:01:43.10,0:01:48.85,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: A NAVY HOSPITAL TRAINING DRILL
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When the newspapers later described him, they called
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:09.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}him a lab technician who had worked 3 years in a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:11.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Philadelphia hospital.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:04.33,0:02:10.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
