Dialogue: 3,0:02:04.33,0:02:10.08,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SUBMARINE CREW AT WORK · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:13.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seadragon got out of the Philippines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By the late summer of 1942, she was sailing from
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:18.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Fremantle, in Western Australia.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.75,0:02:17.50,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
