Dialogue: 3,0:02:11.75,0:02:17.50,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A LONE SUBMARINE ON AN EMPTY SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:33.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seadragon carried no doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:36.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}For medical care, those 55 men had Lipes.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.74,0:02:36.60,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
