Dialogue: 3,0:02:31.74,0:02:36.60,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:39.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A pharmacist's mate was one of the Navy's enlisted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.74,0:02:41.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}medical men, a corpsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.23,0:02:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On a submarine, he was the whole medical department.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.90,0:02:42.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:36.90,0:02:42.65,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:36.90,0:02:42.65,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:02:36.90,0:02:42.65,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:47.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}On September 8, a 19-year-old seaman reported
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}feeling sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:51.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Lipes later remembered finding him in the after
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:54.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}battery compartment, the crew's quarters.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.15,0:02:50.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:45.15,0:02:50.90,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:45.15,0:02:50.90,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:02:45.15,0:02:50.90,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:18.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the NIH is blunt about the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Untreated, an inflamed appendix can burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:24.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}One result is peritonitis, a serious infection that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:26.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}can spread through the abdomen.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.50,0:03:22.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
