Dialogue: 3,0:03:16.50,0:03:22.25,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE AT SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seadragon was several days and thousands of miles
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}out from her base at Fremantle, Australia.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.33,0:03:33.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
