Dialogue: 3,0:03:27.33,0:03:33.08,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:03:27.33,0:03:33.08,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A LONE SUBMARINE ON AN EMPTY SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}What happened next would end up in a Pulitzer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:39.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Prize-winning newspaper story, in a Hollywood movie,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:42.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and, more than 60 years later, in a medal.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:33.82,0:03:39.57,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
