Dialogue: 3,0:03:33.82,0:03:39.57,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE GOES UNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seadragon's commanding officer was Lieutenant
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:49.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Commander William Ferrall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:52.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He asked Lipes whether he could do the operation himself.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.50,0:03:51.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
