Dialogue: 3,0:03:45.50,0:03:51.25,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OFFICERS IN A SUBMARINE WARDROOM · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the Navy's account, he went further.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Our chances, he said, are slim.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:57.30,0:04:01.74,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
