Dialogue: 3,0:03:57.30,0:04:01.74,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:03:57.30,0:04:01.74,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OFFICERS IN A SUBMARINE WARDROOM · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.05,0:04:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The patient had a say too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.70,0:04:17.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}His answer, as the Navy's historians record it, was:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}"Whatever the doc feels has to be done is okay with me."
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.30,0:04:19.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
