Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.00,0:04:23.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Ferrall gave the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Lipes would operate.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.25,0:04:25.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 974 0 l 974 132 l 0 132{\p0}
