Dialogue: 3,0:04:22.25,0:04:25.33,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}PERISCOPE SHEARS OF A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}First, the captain took Seadragon into relatively
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:29.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}safe water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then he dived, and leveled off at 120 feet.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:25.63,0:04:31.38,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
