Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:48.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The operating table was the wardroom mess table,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:49.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}where the officers ate.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:45.48,0:04:49.79,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
