Dialogue: 3,0:04:45.48,0:04:49.79,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OFFICERS IN A SUBMARINE WARDROOM · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:01.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}There was no handle for the scalpel blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So one of the hemostats became the handle.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.47,0:05:04.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 934 0 l 934 132 l 0 132{\p0}
