Dialogue: 3,0:04:59.47,0:05:04.18,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: A NAVY HOSPITAL TRAINING DRILL
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:14.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}For sponges, they used commercially sterilized
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Handi-pads, in their tissue envelopes.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:12.01,0:05:17.19,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
