Dialogue: 3,0:05:12.01,0:05:17.19,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SUBMARINE CREW AT WORK · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}There was no anesthesia mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So they covered a tea strainer with gauze and gave
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:22.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the ether through that.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.49,0:05:23.03,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
