Dialogue: 3,0:05:17.49,0:05:23.03,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:24.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Instruments were boiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Gloves and pajamas were sterilized in alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:28.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Torpedo alcohol.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.33,0:05:29.08,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
