Dialogue: 3,0:05:23.33,0:05:29.08,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SUBMARINE CREW AT WORK · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:32.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The report even records the air inside the boat:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}2 inches of mercury above normal pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:36.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The stitches would be No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}0, 20-day chromic catgut.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:29.54,0:05:35.29,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
