Dialogue: 3,0:05:29.54,0:05:35.29,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:41.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Lipes ground sulfa tablets into powder, and baked
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:44.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the powder in the boat's oven to kill anything that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:46.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}might be living in it.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.27,0:05:45.02,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
