Dialogue: 3,0:05:39.27,0:05:45.02,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:48.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The anesthetist was not a doctor either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:51.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He was Lieutenant Franz Hoskins, the boat's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:52.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}communications officer.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.72,0:05:52.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1017 0 l 1017 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:46.72,0:05:52.47,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:46.72,0:05:52.47,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:05:46.72,0:05:52.47,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OFFICERS IN A SUBMARINE WARDROOM · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the captain stood by, writing down what he saw
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:57.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}every few minutes, for the record.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.53,0:05:58.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 888 0 l 888 132 l 0 132{\p0}
