Dialogue: 3,0:05:53.53,0:05:58.12,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}IWAKUNI, JAPAN · OCT. 23, 2026 · TRAINING
Dialogue: 3,0:05:53.53,0:05:58.12,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: A NAVY MEDICAL TEAM KEEPS NOTES
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Here is where things stood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A sick 19-year-old on a mess table.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A pharmacist's mate with a tea strainer, five spoons
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:19.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and a pocket case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:21.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A communications officer giving the ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.69,0:06:23.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A captain with a notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And a submarine holding her depth in enemy waters.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.77,0:06:17.52,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
