Dialogue: 3,0:06:11.77,0:06:17.52,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE GOES UNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}All around them, the rest of the crew kept the boat
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:38.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:41.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In the after torpedo room, men waited for news.
