Dialogue: 3,0:06:35.93,0:06:41.68,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}INSIDE A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}George Weller, the reporter who later told the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}story, wrote that the order on the boat was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:48.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Keep her steady.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.41,0:06:48.16,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
