Dialogue: 3,0:06:42.41,0:06:48.16,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE GOES UNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Finding the appendix took time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When Lipes found it, the end of it had turned black.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:54.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Gangrene had set in.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.20,0:06:54.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
