Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then he closed the wound layer by layer, dusting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:14.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}each layer with the baked sulfa powder.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.38,0:07:14.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:09.38,0:07:14.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:09.38,0:07:14.54,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
