Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The newspaper story that later made this operation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}famous reported his first words.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:29.00,0:07:34.75,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
