Dialogue: 3,0:07:29.00,0:07:34.75,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}SUBMARINE CREW AT WORK · USS SKATE
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:48.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When he had trouble after the operation, a period
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the report calls post-operative depression, they
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:54.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}gave him oxygen, and he improved markedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:57.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}6 hours after he came round, he was drinking water.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.74,0:07:51.49,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
