Dialogue: 3,0:09:46.78,0:09:52.53,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:09:46.78,0:09:52.53,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE GOES UNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.54,0:10:11.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}15 years later, the television series The Silent
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Service told it again, in an episode called
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:15.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Operation Seadragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:19.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By then, the operation was a legend of the submarine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:19.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}force.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.79,0:10:14.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:08.79,0:10:14.54,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:08.79,0:10:14.54,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:10:08.79,0:10:14.54,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE GOES UNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.33,0:10:37.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Grayback had sailed from Australia on December 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:40.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}1942, exactly one year after Pearl Harbor.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.58,0:10:39.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:33.58,0:10:39.33,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:33.58,0:10:39.33,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:10:33.58,0:10:39.33,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE ON THE SURFACE
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.86,0:10:43.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Her pharmacist's mate, Harry Roby, operated 100 feet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:46.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}beneath the surface, in the Bismarck Archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}His patient was back on watch by the end of the patrol.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.11,0:10:46.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:41.11,0:10:46.86,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:41.11,0:10:46.86,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:10:41.11,0:10:46.86,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE RUNS SUBMERGED
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then, on Christmas Eve, aboard the submarine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.36,0:10:56.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Silversides, the pharmacist's mate performed another
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:57.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}emergency appendectomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:11:00.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It was over at 4 in the morning, on Christmas Day.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:50.97,0:10:56.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 837 0 l 837 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:50.97,0:10:56.72,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:10:50.97,0:10:56.72,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL FILM · 1945 · U.S. NAVY · NOT SEADRAGON
Dialogue: 3,0:10:50.97,0:10:56.72,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE AT SEA
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:04.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Silversides already knew what the war could cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:07.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In May of that year, an enemy machine-gun bullet had
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}killed one of her deck gunners.
