Dialogue: 3,0:11:01.58,0:11:07.33,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE GOES UNDER
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:23.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}None of the three men holding the knife was a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:26.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Each one had a crew at sea, far from any hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:29.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}and a shipmate who needed an emergency operation.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:20.06,0:11:25.81,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
