Dialogue: 3,0:11:20.06,0:11:25.81,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}A U.S. FLEET SUBMARINE ON THE SURFACE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:37.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1944, the Navy identified a need for medical
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}personnel who could work where no medical officer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.69,0:11:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}was available.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:44.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}They became Independent Duty Corpsmen.
