Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1949, that course gave way to a 20-week advanced
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}course in San Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A year later, it grew to 26 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:13.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}As of 2014, independent duty corpsman courses ran in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:17.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}North Carolina, Connecticut and California, and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}submarine service also required Basic Enlisted
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:21.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Submarine School.
