Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Corpsmen have served aboard American submarines
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:26.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}since 1924.
