Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}One of those submarine doctors later told a Navy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}historian about setting a broken leg at sea and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:53.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}putting it in a plaster cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The submarine stayed on patrol, with about 2 or 3
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}weeks still to go.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:45.50,0:12:51.25,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 953 0 l 953 132 l 0 132{\p0}
