Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:12:59.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That did not last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:02.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A study sponsored by the Navy's Bureau of Medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.33,0:13:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}later found that independent duty corpsmen could
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}handle most submarine medical services.
