Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}provider on his ship, told Navy reporters:
Dialogue: 2,0:13:08.64,0:13:14.39,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 953 0 l 953 132 l 0 132{\p0}
