Dialogue: 3,0:13:08.64,0:13:14.39,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TODAY: USS SPRUANCE'S CREW MANS THE RAILS
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}His work, as Navy medicine described it:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:23.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}sick call, medical training for the crew, daily
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}water testing, and pest surveys every two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:29.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}He reported directly to the commanding officer and
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:32.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the executive officer, and he looked after a crew of
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}more than a hundred.
