Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Seadragon served through the whole war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}She made 12 war patrols and earned 11 battle stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:14:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Among the ships she is credited with sinking was the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Japanese submarine I-4.
