Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.14,0:14:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Grayback did not come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:09.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}She was listed as overdue and presumed lost in March 1944.
