Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The young seaman Lipes saved did not survive the war
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:14.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:17.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In October 1944, he was serving aboard the submarine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Tang when she was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Only 9 of her crew survived.
