Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The ceremony was at Camp Lejeune, North Carolina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Years earlier, Lipes recalled, his grandson had
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:02.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}found the story in a schoolbook, and his teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:03.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}told him not to tell stories.
